  (label "PV+" (at 644.00 197.08 270) (fields_autoplaced)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 09956191-988d-4b57-b4e0-db922cbee79b))
  (text "Current paths" (at 20.00 290.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9fdef705-144d-430a-9e3d-866609cd4596))
  (text "1. SUN-SENSOR LOOP: J1 -> D0 -> Q1 -> RSH1 -> GND (drawn in block 1)\n   Panel short-circuit current, ~1 ms every 10 s. Panel Isc 5.40 A (label), max ~6 A in cold strong sun.\n   A vertical panel peaks near 1.8 A at noon. The panel cannot supply more than its Isc.\n2. BOARD SUPPLY: PV+ -> F1 (2 A) -> D1 (3 A) -> buck -> +5V. Under 0.3 A. F1 and D1 are NOT in the measured path.\n3. AUX (optional): PV+ -> F4 (<= 3 A on v1; 9 A only with D5 on a heatsink) -> D5 -> J12. Never through the shunt.\nJ1 and J12 '>= 15 A' is the terminal and wire rating, not a measured current." (at 20.00 293.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 15b0077e-0f7c-4efe-a277-34c3103a21fa))
  (text "Measurement ranges" (at 20.00 320.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 96479d04-54eb-4f1c-bf0c-853aa4ecdb5e))
  (text "ISENSE (GPIO 35): RSH1 5 mOhm x INA180A3 gain 100 = 0.5 V/A. Range 0-6 A (pulsed); output clamps at 3.3 V (~6.6 A), harmless.\n   U2 IN+ and IN- are Kelvin traces from the inner ends of RSH1's pads (drawn as separate wires from the shunt).\nVDIV (GPIO 34): R1 100k / R2 4k7 = x 22.3. Voc 44.5 V -> 2.00 V; 48 V -> 2.15 V; 60 V -> 2.69 V. Firmware DIVIDER = (100 + 4.7) / 4.7." (at 20.00 323.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid b74ccabf-d296-4843-9c4e-b6ef6cda0fac))
  (text "ESP32 module and Q1 gate" (at 20.00 345.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 26c7e8f8-e7f0-4752-bbfd-df0b9e4c6e94))
  (text "The ESP32 is a complete ELEGOO dev board plugged into J14/J15: EN pull-up, buttons, USB-serial and strapping are on that board.\nEN and GPIO 0, 1, 2, 3, 12, 15 are not brought out. GPIO 5 (strapping) is held high by R14.\nQ1 gate: U3 drives it when +5V exists; R21 (100k, gate-source) holds Q1 off before that, at dawn.\nD6 (TVS on PV+): footprint only; fitted if the v1 bench test shows turn-off overshoot. Then Q1 >= 100 V." (at 20.00 348.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5e22b45c-8a82-4a34-bcce-32ad3242d94c))
